  ["AFIMAC Critical Situation Travel Labor", ["Best for critical, time-sensitive gaps local hiring can’t fill", "AFIMAC recruits, travels, houses, and manages the team on site", "Right answer when the need is urgent and the cost of waiting is high"], true],
];

