  ["Speed to productive crew", "14–35 days", "Days"],
  ["Labor pool", "Local market only", "National network, mobilized to you"],
  ["Travel &amp; housing", "Rarely handled", "Fully handled"],
  ["Screening &amp; safety onboarding", "Partial", "AFIMAC, site-specific"],
