  <div class="note stop"><b>Both SEO fields break the house formula, by a lot.</b> The title runs <b>79 characters</b> against the 50–60 the other twelve decks follow, and the meta description runs <b>186</b> against 145–160. Google will truncate both. This is the only deck in the set that misses on either.</div>`,
    spec: `The SEO fields need trimming before build — everything else is ready to drop in.`,
  },

